    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39524" root="نخب" body-key="n">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انخب</span></b>  (as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انجب</span>, TA) <i>He begot a
cowardly son:</i> (K:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْخُوبٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انخب</span> <i>He begot a brave,</i> or <i>courageous, son:</i> (K:)
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُخَبَةٌ</span>. (TA.) Thus the verb bears two
contr. significations. (K.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انجب</span>.

